node_modules/* top-level entries are symlinks into .pnpm.\n\nLet me check what's actually missing. Let me get a full top-level listing and compare with a known-good reference: another worktree's node_modules? No, they each have their own.\n\nHmm, actually: is there another worktree with identical node_modules I could compare against? Like D:/ClawX? Let me check if D:/ClawX has node_modules.\n\nLet me first fully assess."}}
